# Background worker

## Files

- `background/service-worker.js` — message router, AI generation, license, PDF trigger, queue, external web
- `background/queue-processor.js` — bulk queue (reuse `sourceTabId` when open, else background tab)
- `background/tab-jobs.js` — `listOpenJobTabs`, `queueItemsFromTabs` for workspace tab browser
- `offscreen/offscreen.html` + `pdf-generator.js` — HTML → html2canvas → jsPDF (vendored deps)

## Message types (popup/content → background)

Core: `JOB_DETECTED`, `GENERATE_APPLICATION`, `FILL_FORM`, `GENERATE_PDF`, `VALIDATE_LICENSE`, `GET_APPLICATION_COUNT`, `APPLICATION_SUBMITTED`, `TEST_API_KEY`, `SCRAPE_ACTIVE_TAB`, `ESTIMATE_GENERATION_COST`

Queue / tabs: `PROCESS_QUEUE`, `ADD_QUEUE_URLS`, `ADD_TABS_TO_QUEUE`, `LIST_JOB_TABS`, `GET_QUEUE`, `CLEAR_QUEUE`

Widget: `WIDGET_GENERATE`, `OPEN_BLITZ`, `BLITZ_PAGE_STATE`

External: `chrome.runtime.onMessageExternal` for `localhost` / `127.0.0.1` (web dashboard) — same `handleMessage` switch

Return `{ error: string }` on failure. Use `return true` + `sendResponse` for async handlers.

## PDF / offscreen

- Check `chrome.offscreen.hasDocument()` before `createDocument`
- `GENERATE_PDF_OFFSCREEN` must **not** be handled in service worker (`return false` so offscreen receives it)
- Reasons: `DOM_SCRAPING` for PDF justification
- HTML assembly: `popup/src/lib/cv-export.js` → `buildRenderedCvHtml`; template in storage key `cv_html_template`
- Postinstall: `copy-offscreen-deps.mjs` copies jspdf + html2canvas into `offscreen/`

## Imports

Shared code from `../popup/src/lib/` (storage, ai, prompts, license). Keep imports relative; no bundler for SW.

## Lifecycle

MV3 SW sleeps after ~30s — persist state in `chrome.storage`, not module-level variables.
